#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_layout
#! frames  220
#! poster  110
#! keys
# the form at 15 pixels; ctrl+up three times: 18, 21, 24, the form grows and keeps its shape, the buttons stay at the
# right edge; ctrl+down four times: 21, 18, 15, 12; ctrl+up once: back to 15
0   move 450 400
10  move 330 330 15
40  key shortcut down
41  key up
42  key shortcut up
60  key shortcut down
61  key up
62  key shortcut up
80  key shortcut down
81  key up
82  key shortcut up
125 key shortcut down
126 key down
127 key shortcut up
140 key shortcut down
141 key down
142 key shortcut up
155 key shortcut down
156 key down
157 key shortcut up
170 key shortcut down
171 key down
172 key shortcut up
200 key shortcut down
201 key up
202 key shortcut up
